card.statement:
Let $V_q$ be an irreducible $\cH_q$-module in $\mathscr{K}_q$ with a $\C(q)$-linear basis $\{v_j\}_{j\in J}$, and let $\lambda \in \hh^*$ with $\lambda(c)\neq 0$. Then,

- $M_q(\lambda, V_q)$ is a free $\cU^-_q$-module generated by $\{v_j\}_{j\in J}$;

- $\dim M_q(\lambda, V_q)_\mu=\infty$ for any $\mu = \lambda-\beta +n\delta$, $\beta \in Q^+\setminus\{0\}$, $n\in \Z$;

- $\dim M_q(\lambda, V_q)_\mu<\infty$ if and only if $V_q$ is a $\varphi$-Verma module of $\cH_q$ with $\varphi$ constant and $\mu=\lambda- \varphi(n)n\delta$, $n\in \Z_{\geq 0}$;

- $M_q^\varphi(\lambda)$ is a free $\cN^{-\varphi}_q$-module generated by $1\otimes v_{\varphi}$.
